            "confidence": "high"
          },
          {
            "text": "Wired exact xAI pricing for Grok 4.6 into both the runtime pricing table and the benchmark pricing script, including a cached-input rate of $0.50/MTok and a long-context step-up that kicks in at 200K input tokens.",
            "commit_shas": [
              "06999fbcdee03b611c5a1d5c57bbd0def3e3690d"
            ],
            "confidence": "high"
          },
          {
            "text": "Normalized aliases like aura-grok-4-6 and xai/grok-4.6 so persisted sessions and raw provider ids resolve cleanly onto the new model.",
